{
  "request_id": "7c804cdaea334c1bb1dcf7dc74d23d72",
  "data": {
    "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">各位亲爱的指挥官： </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">司令部将于</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">7</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">30</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日10:00~1</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">:00对以下港区进行为期</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">小时的改造建设（如有变动将会另行发布通知）。改建期间将暂时无法进入港区，还请各位指挥官提前做好下线准备，</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">给各位带来的不便敬请谅解。 </span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">『涉及港区』 </span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">安卓全港区、iOS全港区、HarmonyOS NEXT全港区</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">『改建内容』</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">一、内容新增</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">「密语档案室」</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">新增</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">以下密语剧情贩售：</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">◆全新</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">贩售</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">◆（7月30日维护后~8月5日23:59）</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">亚尔薇特-「</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">今夜的身体检查</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」（日文）</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">◆复刻</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">贩售</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">◆（7月30日维护后~8月5日23:59）</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">腓德雷卡&middot;卡尔</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">-「微醺之爱的夏夜邂逅」</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（日文）</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">◆常驻</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">贩售</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">◆</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">埃玛</span>-<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">「至高的嘉奖」（日文）</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">※指挥官可于「主界面-回忆」中进入「密语档案室」，花费120钻石或3张密语奖券解锁密语剧情。在解锁密语剧情前，可进行试听；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">※相关内容请勿上传或分享至游戏外平台；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">2.</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">开启限时复刻活动</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">「限界挑战：</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">狮子座</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」，活动时间</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">8</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月1日00:00~</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">8</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月31日23:59</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">指挥官等级达到</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">80级以后可进行「限界挑战」挑战。「限界挑战」共分为窥探、审视、洞察三种难度，指挥官在关卡的规定时间内通关即为挑战成功。完成前一模式挑战方可解锁后续模式挑战。</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">本次「限界挑战：狮子座」中，完成窥探难度可获得</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">头像框「限界的挑战者Ⅲ</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」</span></strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，完成审视难度可获得</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">星座聊天气泡「限界的挑战者&middot;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">狮子座</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」</span></strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，完成洞察难度可获得</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">星座头像框「限界的挑战者&middot;</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">狮子座</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」</span></strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※重复获取头像框、聊天气泡</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">将自动折算为物资；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※「限界挑战」不消耗石油，不消耗舰船的好感与心情，战斗胜负不会被计入个人信息统计，也无法获得舰船经验、指挥官经验和指挥喵经验；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※「限界挑战」以</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">12个月为周期轮换开放，关卡再次开放时，以往错过奖励的指挥官仍能够获取奖励</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.开启新一期「世界巡游」活动，活动时间8月1日 00:00~9月30日23:59</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">活动期间，指挥官可通过完成巡游任务获取「巡游点数」。巡游任务随时间开放解锁，每获取100点「巡游点数」即可增加1巡游进度。巡游进度提升后可以获取相应等级的奖励，巡游进度最高可达100。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">【奖励规则】</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">巡游进度奖励分为「基础巡游奖励」与「特许巡游奖励」：</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">①&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">基础巡游奖励</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">当巡游达到指定进度时，指挥官可以直接免费领取包含</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">诺菈&middot;META</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">、特装型布里MKIII、心智魔方、高级定向蓝图&middot;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">九</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">期在内的基础巡游奖励；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">②&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">特许巡游奖励</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">「特许巡游凭证」（售价&yen;68）可于&ldquo;商店-优惠礼包&rdquo;中购买，购买后可立刻获得1500「巡游点数」(即15巡游进度)，巡游达到指定进度时可领取包含昆西换装「</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">放学后的补习时间</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」、战斗界面主题（</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">皇家旧影</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）、钻石在内的特许巡游奖励；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※购买「特许巡游凭证」不会影响基础巡游奖励的领取；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※「特许巡游凭证」将于本期活动结束一个小时前（即9月30日22:59）停止售卖，还请指挥官注意购买时间；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">【特别提醒】</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※在本期世界巡游活动结束后，所有巡游任务将会无法继续完成，所有巡游奖励将会无法继续领取，还请务必注意活动结束时间，提前领取奖励。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※巡游进度、「特许巡游凭证」仅对本期世界巡游活动生效；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※世界巡游新增到期奖励补发功能，未领取的奖励将通过</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">「</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">补偿</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">」</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">进行发放；</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※本次维护后，临近到期时的世界巡游奖励领取提示将取消；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.往期商店兑换新增（8月1日0点后）：</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">外观：</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">兔兔导弹、多变箭头、像素爱心</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">鱼雷</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">、能量球子弹</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">角色：黑暗界&middot;</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">META</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">换装：梅-「猫咖逢春」</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※同一换装至多可购买1次，购买1件需要「钻石」&times;880；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※装备外观每期至多可购买4次，购买1件需要「钻石」&times;100，同一装备外观同时至多拥有9个；</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; backgrou